        "review": "Pretty neat little game. Benny's a silly little guy.\n\nThe puzzles are pretty good overall, though keep in mind one literally requires you to solve a type of cypher, so you either need to already have this niche outside knowledge, or look up how the cypher method works. I've always had mixed feelings about those types of puzzles. It reminds me of 90's era adventure games that expected kids to know morse code when no one was being taught morse code anymore.\n\nStill, for the price this is a fun little puzzle horror experience.",
